// Modifications: the `Box<i32>` arm dropped (Box incidental). The `Option<T>`
//   arm is ALSO dropped: a blanket `impl<T: MyCopy> Get for T` instantiated at
//   `Option<u16>` (whose MyCopy comes from `impl<T: Copy> MyCopy for Option<T>`)
